+            // Local subprocess pipes use AF_UNIX socketpairs. Permit only the
+            // descriptor metadata and write-half-close required by libuv; none
+            // of these operations creates or connects a socket. Other socket
+            // options, mutations, connection operations and families stay denied.
+            // getsockname is read-only metadata and needs no seccomp rule.
+            rules.insert(
